n the previous comparison for review.</p></article></div><div class="related"><a class="text-link" href="/trust/">Explore read and execution boundaries <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/your-world/">Explore another world <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section><!-- titan-community:v1 --><section class="cm-band cm-band--lite" data-titan-community="v1" data-cm-mode="section" aria-labelledby="cm-h"><div class="cm-band__col"><div class="cm-card"><div class="cm-card__text"><p class="cm-eyebrow">Community <span class="cm-chip cm-chip--building"><i class="cm-tri" aria-hidden="true"></i>Building</span></p><h2 class="cm-band__h" id="cm-h">Make Atlas yours.</h2><p class="cm-band__lede">Scripts, skins and ideas from people who use Atlas, and a place to ask for help; community scripts never run near your money or your personal data.</p><p class="cm-band__actions"><a class="cm-btn" href="https://titanatlas.live/communities/">Open Atlas Communities</a></p></div><ul class="cm-card__spaces" aria-label="Community spaces"><li><a href="https://titanatlas.live/communities/#scripts">Scripts</a></li><li><a href="https://titanatlas.live/communities/#redesigns">Redesigns</a></li><li><a href="https://titanatlas.live/communities/#skins">Skins</a></li><li><a href="https://titanatlas.live/communities/#industry">Industry forums</a></li><li><a href="https://titanatlas.live/communities/#support">Support</a></li><li><a href="https://titanatlas.live/communities/#feature-requests">Feature requests</a></li><li><a href="https://titanatlas.live/communities/#bugs">Bug submissions</a></li></ul></div></div></section><!-- /titan-community --></main><section class="cta wrap"><div><p class="eyebrow">START WITH YOUR WORLD</p><h2>What should your Atlas<br><em>carry forward?</em></h2></div><a class="button" href="/contact/">Let’s talk about it <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section><!-- titan-footer-standard:r12 -->
